/* Microphone permission (shown to grown-ups in the iOS permission dialog). */
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "For grown-ups: in some games Minkino detects your child's blowing, voice and clapping instantly and only on this device. Audio is never recorded, stored or sent anywhere. Without permission, every game can be played by touch.";
/* Add-to-Photos permission (when the Draw & Come Alive card is saved). */
"NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription" = "For grown-ups: lets you save your child's picture card to Photos, only when you choose to. Minkino never reads your photos or sends them anywhere.";
/* Speech recognition permission (speaking games; on-device only). */
"NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription" = "For grown-ups: in speaking games Minkino recognizes the word your child says only on this device. Audio is never recorded, stored or sent to Apple or anywhere else. Without permission, the game still moves on by voice or by touch.";
